knowing the<br />
full</p>
<p>the deer<br />
died following<br />
the toyota<br />
in the cornfield<br />
with the state park<br />
looming.</p>
<p>trees turn<br />
to fire<br />
at dawn.</p>
<p>then Handscome thinks one last think a rinky dink (im trying to finish [stop]) before he passes into elysium fields and that's what he thinks elysium fields abandon all hope ye who enter here the styx the lyre the ending in the beginning.</p>
<p>(she's tearing at his eyes now)</p>
